  destinations:
  - destinationName: Bamboo Forest
    description: 'Tall bamboo sways gently as sunlight filters through the leaves.

      Peaceful
      pathways guide your journey into nature''s quiet beauty.

      Hidden treasures
      rest between the towering green stalks.

      Every step feels calm, balanced,
      and refreshing.'
    background: {fileID: 2906209119599174030, guid: 379b3d989441c41329f4593c94a33d3f, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Zen Garden
    description: 'Carefully arranged stones and peaceful gardens create perfect harmony.

      The
      gentle sound of flowing water calms every traveler.

      Take your time exploring
      each peaceful corner.

      Balance and beauty await your discovery.'
    background: {fileID: -5516008940900807360, guid: 2f7fbc4e98fca4fc99e6fbea21800ea9, type: 3}
  - destinationName: River Bridge
    description: 'A wooden bridge stretches across a sparkling mountain river.

      Crystal-clear
      water flows peacefully beneath your feet.

      Explore both sides of the
      valley to uncover hidden rewards.

      Every crossing begins a new adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 3572718391364940844, guid: 412362d2e62fe4479b647768b5bedb25, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Temple Gate
    description: 'An ancient gate welcomes visitors into a sacred mountain sanctuary.

      Stone
      pathways reveal centuries of history and tradition.

      Every puzzle unlocks
      another forgotten story.

      The journey grows more mysterious with every
      step.'
    background: {fileID: 6125924906015428500, guid: 74a79c63bd3644e5f8769becb68f46b3, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Waterfall
    description: 'Crystal-clear water cascades through lush tropical cliffs.

      Mist
      cools the air while birds sing high above the trees.

      Hidden caves and
      secret pathways wait beyond the flowing water.

      Nature''s beauty shines
      at every turn.'
    background: {fileID: -4219545354283001210, guid: d9575051acf6d466798b43eb0323e040, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Mountain Path
    description: 'Steep trails climb toward breathtaking mountain views.

      Every
      step rewards explorers with spectacular scenery.

      Hidden shortcuts lead
      to exciting discoveries.

      The summit is only the beginning of your journey.'
    background: {fileID: 3615442613106613315, guid: 47ddc6399fdc04c6bbdf74a6f7cc3bb9, type: 3}
